    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Adjustable frequency to remove stubborn calculus, tartar and teeth stain.<\/p><p>✔ Each full charge can last up to 200 uses!<\/p><p>✔Portable & Durable - it's perfect for both home & travel.<\/p><p>✔ Advanced Vibration Technology - Up to 12,000 times per minute high intensity frequency.<\/p><p>✔ Approved & Recommended by Dentists worldwide!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner is very easy and simple to use.<\/p><p><\/p><p>1. Wash the tip of your Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner <\/p><p>2. Turn on your device<\/p><p>3. Place the vibrating tip on (and around) your stubborn calculus, plaque, tar and teeth stains.<\/p><p>4. Rinse your warm with warm water.<\/p><p>5. Instantly see a major improvement!<\/p><p>Recommended: Repeat 4x a week (up to 2 minutes a session)<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner consists of:<\/p><p>1x Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner<\/p><p>1x Micro USB Cable<\/p><p>1x Manual<\/p><p>Each order of Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner Pro (5 in 1) consists of:<\/p><p>1 x Cordless Electric Toothbrush<\/p><p>4 x Attachment Heads (plaque remover, tongue brusher, toothbrush and flosser)<\/p><p>1 x Dental Tooth Mirror<\/p><p>1x Stainless Steel Pick<\/p><p>1 x USB Charger<\/p><p>1 x Instruction Manual<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✘ Don't overuse the tooth cleaner, we recommend 4x times a week, 2 minutes per session.<\/p><p>✘ Not safe for Children under the age of 12.<\/p><p>✔ Only buy CE & UL Certified Tooth Cleaners.<\/p><p>✔ Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cons of not using an Ultra Sonic Tooth Cleaner",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Bad dental hygiene can be devastating on teeth and gums. Not only can it be expensive, but it can also lead to bad breath, gum disease, receding gums, dental decay, and even tooth loss.<\/p><p>This product may also be reffered to as one of the following:<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Calculus remover, Dental irrigator, Dental scaler, Oral irrigator, Plaque remover, Tartar removal tool, Tartar remover, Tooth cleaner, Tooth stain remover, Ultrasonic dental cleaner, Ultrasonic scaler, Ultrasonic tooth cleaner.<\/em><\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
